          "text": "CHRYSOS | #Cyrene\n\nOnward I Fly, Across a Sea of Time\n\nCyrene, Daughter of Aedes Elysiae, sow the Seed of Memory, so that flowers of the past may bloom in tomorrow.\n\n\"Whether as the cute Mem, the lively Cyrene, or now as the mature and beautiful me, my charm never changes ♪\"\n\"The magnificent stories that unfolded in Amphoreus will surely be engraved in the cosmos. And the marks left by the Trailblaze will definitely extend even further into the distance. Now, let's write the final period of this story together ♪\"\n\n▉ Vol. 13 \"Ripples of Past Reverie\" Cyrene\n\nProducer: Galactic Baseballer\nPhotography: Graymera (Chimera)\nStyling: Cyrene\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/WeIdeXdZcs\n\n#HonkaiStarRail"
